 "\[LineSeparator]",
 "is the band of radii from ",
 StyleBox["rmin", "TI"],
 " to ",
 StyleBox["rmax", "TI"],
 ".",
 "\n",
 Cell["   ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->"f48e176d-4e11-49ce-b407-33c1eaaca48f"],
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   TemplateBox[{
     Cell[
      TextData["InfraShell"]], 
